# UI/UX & Component Patterns

## Design System Foundation
- Built on shadcn/ui component library with Radix UI primitives
- Tailwind CSS with custom design tokens in [tailwind.config.js](mdc:tailwind.config.js)
- Dark/light theme support with CSS variables
- Consistent spacing, typography, and color scales

## Component Architecture

### shadcn/ui Components
Base UI components are located in [src/components/ui](mdc:src/components/ui):
- [Button](mdc:src/components/ui/button.tsx) - Primary interaction element
- [Form components](mdc:src/components/ui/form.tsx) - Form structure and validation
- Input, Select, Dialog, Sheet, etc. - All following shadcn/ui patterns

### Component Variant System
Use `class-variance-authority` (cva) for component variants:

```typescript
import { cva, type VariantProps } from 'class-variance-authority';
import { cn } from '@/lib/utils';

const buttonVariants = cva(
  'inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors',
  {
    variants: {
      variant: {
        default: 'bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary/90',
        destructive: 'bg-destructive text-destructive-foreground hover:bg-destructive/90',
        outline: 'border border-input bg-background hover:bg-accent',
        secondary: 'bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground hover:bg-secondary/80',
        ghost: 'hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground',
        link: 'text-primary underline-offset-4 hover:underline',
      },
      size: {
        default: 'h-10 px-4 py-2',
        sm: 'h-9 rounded-md px-3',
        lg: 'h-11 rounded-md px-8',
        icon: 'h-10 w-10',
      },
    },
    defaultVariants: {
      variant: 'default',
      size: 'default',
    },
  }
);

interface ButtonProps
  extends React.ButtonHTMLAttributes<HTMLButtonElement>,
    VariantProps<typeof buttonVariants> {
  asChild?: boolean;
}
```

### Component Composition Patterns

#### Form Input Components
Custom form inputs extend base UI components with consistent patterns:

```typescript
interface InputFieldProps extends InputHTMLAttributes<HTMLInputElement> {
  fieldName: string;
  label: string;
  info?: string;
  description?: string;
  classNames?: {
    label?: string;
    input?: string;
    error?: string;
    formItem?: string;
    description?: string;
  };
}

const InputField = ({ fieldName, label, info, ...props }: InputFieldProps) => {
  const { control } = useFormContext();
  
  return (
    <FormField
      name={fieldName}
      control={control}
      render={({ field }) => (
        <FormItem className="w-full space-y-0.5">
          <FormLabel className="flex gap-2 pl-1 text-base font-medium">
            {label}
            {info && <TooltipHelper content={info}><InfoIcon /></TooltipHelper>}
          </FormLabel>
          <FormControl>
            <Input {...field} {...props} />
          </FormControl>
          <FormMessage className="text-xs pl-1" />
        </FormItem>
      )}
    />
  );
};
```

#### Dialog/Modal Components
Use Sheet for side panels, Dialog for modals:

```typescript
export const AddUserSheet = ({ children, onSuccess }: AddUserSheetProps) => {
  const [open, setOpen] = useState(false);
  
  return (
    <Sheet open={open} onOpenChange={setOpen}>
      <SheetTrigger asChild>{children}</SheetTrigger>
      <SheetContent className="w-full sm:max-w-md">
        <SheetHeader>
          <SheetTitle>Add New User</SheetTitle>
          <SheetDescription>Create a new user account</SheetDescription>
        </SheetHeader>
        {/* Form content */}
        <SheetFooter>
          <Button type="submit">Save</Button>
        </SheetFooter>
      </SheetContent>
    </Sheet>
  );
};
```

